Description: WF2489T wall tablet: Home Assistant kiosk and board support
 Boot splash (Debian logo), kiosk (labwc, TouchKio, squeekboard) on the display, LED ring and ambient
 light sensor and a camera person sensor (on the NPU) in Home Assistant via MQTT, AIC8800 Bluetooth, Ethernet via
 DHCP, and the kernel for the board. Kiosk settings: /etc/default/kiosk.
